              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Pam Ziegler Lutz"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This rub is quick to throw together and tastes great. I used it on baby back ribs and it really gave the meat a wonderful flavor. Ignore the calories and servings on this recipe. I had a lot left over after coating a full slab of ribs on both sides."
          },
