              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SLJ6"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent! Loved this rub. I used on pork that I marinated in this rub and put in the crock pot. After 8-10 hours, shredded the meat and added our fave BBQ sauce. Excellent BBQ pork! Family loved...thanks!",
