            },
            "reviewBody": "Used this with a slow cooker for game day pork butt and I received nothing but compliments! I removed some of the fat/excess liquid off prior to shedding the meat apart. I used all of this on approx 8 lbs of pork butt - THANK YOU for the great recipe! *I added 2 cloves of minced fresh garlic and 1/2 sliced onion on top as well.",
